---
const title = "Microsoft Entra ID & Active Directory Integration - AtlasIT Marketplace";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{title}</title>
</head>
<body class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 text-slate-100 min-h-screen">
  <main class="container mx-auto px-6 py-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Microsoft Entra ID & Active Directory Integration</h1>
    <div class="glass-effect p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Quick Integration Walkthrough</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal ml-6 space-y-3">
        <li>Authorize AtlasIT to access your Microsoft Entra ID and Active Directory <button class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg ml-2">Connect to Entra & AD</button></li>
        <li>Configure which directory services to sync:
          <div class="mt-2">
            <label class="block mb-1">Select Directory Services:</label>
            <select class="input-field w-full px-3 py-2 bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-600 rounded text-slate-100 text-sm">
              <option value="">Choose...</option>
              <option value="entra">Microsoft Entra ID</option>
              <option value="ad">Active Directory</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>Set notification preferences:
          <div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm">
            <label class="flex items-center"><input type="checkbox" class="mr-2"> User Provisioning</label>
            <label class="flex items-center"><input type="checkbox" class="mr-2"> Security Alerts</label>
            <label class="flex items-center"><input type="checkbox" class="mr-2"> Group Changes</label>
            <label class="flex items-center"><input type="checkbox" class="mr-2"> Compliance Events</label>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>Finish setup and test integration <button class="px-4 py-2 bg-green-600 text-white rounded-lg ml-2">Test Integration</button></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
